Package: epiIneq
Type: Package
Title: Health Inequity Measurement for Surveillance Counts
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("EpiStack", "Authors", email = "epistack@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: EpiStack Authors [aut, cre]
Maintainer: EpiStack Authors <epistack@example.com>
Description: Inequity layer (L4) of the EpiStack ecosystem. Computes
    population-weighted concentration curves and concentration indices,
    slope indices of inequality by weighted regression, SES-group
    decomposition with rate differences, rate ratios and avoided fractions,
    and distance-decay spatial accessibility from coordinates and facilities.
    All statistics run in base R; no spatial or inequality packages required.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 3.6.0)
Imports: stats, utils
Suggests: epiCore
NeedsCompilation: no
URL: https://github.com/Rythonme/EpiStack
BugReports: https://github.com/Rythonme/EpiStack/issues
